{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項針對中國成年人開展的大規模研究顯示，經常飲茶與更低的血管疾病風險相關。不過，研究人員同時指出，茶葉種類、茶湯濃度以及飲用温度等因素都會影響這一關聯，其中飲用「非常燙」的熱茶反而與更高的患病風險有關。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1584152.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T08:41:52.494149+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:30:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:38:22.361571+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:38:22.361571+00:00","content_hash":"f4d854a55dc453f74898471a4f366caeb1844a7fc02e5b0d72448ddcca0b7293","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}